      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "小满的\"满\"是渐进而非圆满——中国人的处世哲学中留有余地的智慧。",
        "en": "Xiaoman's \"fullness\" is progressive, not complete — reflecting a philosophy of leaving room."
      },
